{title: Father, Let Me Know Your Will}
{artist: Larry Holder}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 80}

Verse 1
Father, let me know Your will,
Father, let me know Your will,
For Thine alone is the Word of Truth:
Father, let me know Your will.

Verse 2
Jesus, guide me in Your Way,
Jesus, guide me in Your Way,
For Thou alone art the Bread of Life:
Jesus, guide me in Your Way.

Verse 3
Father, let me know Your will,
Father, let me know Your will,
Thy Truth has come; He abideth still:
Father, let me know Your will.
